{"title":"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many integers are greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/f/c7f6d1e000d3e8c4cb552e4905ed41ad2fa540bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> and less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/6/8a6d1b584a42c88275d2ae86a59079aad25c034f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/d/2bd3d0644a7d024262685e452cd5be5cebab7a14.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 3 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 4 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 6 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 5 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"388\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Listing_Integers.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Listing_Integers)\">Solution 1 (Listing Integers)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Listing Integers)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is too small because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/c/7bc89cf0b834b336d685c821e817f8bc296e3dc1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{2} = 9 &lt; 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"18\" /> but <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/e/d0e9136809f832318fdd66a5180d0e20660e072b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^{2} = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"17\" />, which is greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and is also less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/906734e2f1010e9a171ffee8050cbc0649cea37c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. We also know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is too large because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/b/e3b4e0e67cb52270a78ce9780704dbdcee457826.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8^{2} = 64$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"59\" height=\"15\" /> but <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is small enough because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/a/24acc458ce27972d20b1349d2eb9d8ae77b3d9b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7^{2} = 49$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"17\" />, which is less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/906734e2f1010e9a171ffee8050cbc0649cea37c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>We can then list all of the integers, which is simple because there aren't that many:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> would be the integers satisfying the conditions.\n</p><p>Counting these, we see that there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/4/78431c70c8a0e96ab8ac939de6625d8244d02c9c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(B) } 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"57\" height=\"30\" /> possible integers.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Like in solution 1, we can realize that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> would have to be the smallest integer possible and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is the largest integer possible. However, we don't have to list all of the possible integers.\n</p><p>There would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/e/d2e4b6466cf5fef3d297b0398e3dc7f7d6a600c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7 - 4 + 1 = 3 + 1 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(B) } 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"218\" height=\"30\" /> possible integers.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat\">2024 CEMC Fermat</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 9 (page does not exist)\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 10 (page does not exist)\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 11 (page does not exist)\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 12 (page does not exist)\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 13 (page does not exist)\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 14 (page does not exist)\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 15 (page does not exist)\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2